# Allow-list: nothing enters the build context unless it is named here, so new local clutter can never reach it.
# Keep in step with the COPY lines in Dockerfile.
*
!cmd
!internal
!starter
!web
!go.mod
!go.sum
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md

# Inside web/: the image installs its own modules and builds dist itself
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/uat
web/playwright-report
web/test-results
web/blob-report

# Never ship env files or Go test binaries, wherever they sit
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.test
